  "notes": [
    "Regular -AR verb — follows standard -AR endings with no exceptions",
    "Past participle: *alojado* (regular)",
    "Means \"to lodge,\" \"to accommodate,\" or \"to house\" — *el hotel aloja a cien huéspedes* (the hotel accommodates a hundred guests)",
    "Reflexive *alojarse* is very common for \"to stay\" (at a hotel/place): *nos alojamos en un hotel céntrico* (we stayed at a hotel downtown)",
